<title>USA: San Miguel sets 10 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>San Miguel sets 10 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>San Miguel Corp said on Thursday it declared a 10 percent stock dividend and a 20-centavo cash dividend for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The Filipino company, based in Manila, said the stock dividend is payable on June 27 to shareholders of record as of May 15, if approved by stockholders.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable April 25 to holders as of March 13.</p>
<p>San Miguel is involved in brewing, food products and packaging.</p>
<p>	 ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
